        "created_at": "2017-08-11T18:42:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, who should we share texting information with?&nbsp;My online access is highly limited once I'm at the Con, so I'd prefer to have contact information set up before that point</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Agreed. Maybe a google doc? &nbsp;I can't set one up right now but will when I get home tonight if no one beats me to it.</p>",
