        "created_at": "2017-08-12T13:47:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yesterday ended up being a much longer day than expected, so I'm doing it this morning. In case anyone is squeamish about having their phone number out on the internet, I'm just going to PM a link to everyone who has posted above me so you can add your info.</p><p>Anyone else who wants to be included, just send me a PM or post in this thread and I'll send it to you as well. Note that I probably won't have internet access most of the time I'm in Indy, so you should do this before Wednesday.</p>",
