        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-18T05:15:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… So, games?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Tonight we played games at the Hilton Embassy Suites, a few blocks north of the convention center. The space was nice with plenty of tables, and we're planning to play games there again tomorrow.</p>\n<p>(Did you see the Google Doc that grysqrl sent a link to with phone numbers, through the messaging system on the forum?)</p>",
