        "created_at": "2017-08-18T21:37:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sure, we may or may not be there (annoyingly, we’re booked in for an event sometime tonight), and if this continues tomorrow we’ll definitely be along.</p>\n<p>I’ll put our number in the doc, Internet permitting, but it’s an international number so I don’t know how that works. Alternately add Curtis Reubens on Facebook and message me there.</p>",
